+      "Red Curse": "About 1 in 10 are affected. Those specimens need cinnabryl to avoid Affliction and are worth 420 XP when they have a Legacy. Their entry names Fly, Anti-Missile, Leap, Projectile, and War Cry as desirable choices. It gives no default Legacy for an individual. The compendium’s general monster Legacy rules allow three uses per day once fully active and immediate use once activated. The initial week permits one use per day. Its powers fade after leaving the Red Curse and Haze. See printed pp. 6–9.",
